            "contentId": "ch2_3049",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "金兰观工作人员提醒您，前方通往戏台的路段近期人口失踪事件频发。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6839.2001953125,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "94046f4e-614e-4c16-9556-3314be268751",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3050",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "为保障大会期间的正常秩序与人员安全，请所有游客及工作人员遵守以下规则。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7156.80029296875,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6f506cfb-0a27-4e93-81a2-bf3e6b2037ab",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3051",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "1.若您在离开前方街道后，发现自己再次进入相同街道，请保持冷静注意观察。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7491.2001953125,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "4e8bf6e5-71ee-4b55-b608-33843207e030",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3052",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "2.经幸存者证言，您第一次通过的街道为绝对安全的，可以此为参照。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7824.0,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1b0e3c2e-7096-41f9-832d-785787c98111",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3053",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "3.如果您发现街道中存在有异常现象，请立刻转身，向左离开街道。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8142.400390625,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "62f03528-53a8-4d99-b770-61d92a63afdc",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3054",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "4.如果街道中一切正常，请继续前进，向右前往戏台方向。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8460.7998046875,
            "positionY": 316.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
